    <item>
      <title>阅读55k帖子终于等到飞升3级，抽一个月有效期的500次gemini调用次数（回帖请注意论坛准则，不要水帖子）</title>
      <link>https://linux.do/t/topic/2397910</link>
      <guid>linux.do-topic-2397910</guid>
      <pubDate>Sun, 14 Jun 2026 00:51:12 GMT</pubDate>
      <description>
            &lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;lightbox-wrapper&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;lightbox&quot; href=&quot;https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/original/4X/5/0/5/505925456d997a1331f0a67089d2437c1273a35a.png&quot; data-download-href=&quot;/uploads/short-url/bsNbQUgtAvbv1MPJz7ue1dT8g1c.png?dl=1&quot; title=&quot;image&quot; rel=&quot;noopener nofollow ugc&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/optimized/4X/5/0/5/505925456d997a1331f0a67089d2437c1273a35a_2_483x500.png&quot; alt=&quot;image&quot; data-base62-sha1=&quot;bsNbQUgtAvbv1MPJz7ue1dT8g1c&quot; width=&quot;483&quot; height=&quot;500&quot; srcset=&quot;https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/optimized/4X/5/0/5/505925456d997a1331f0a67089d2437c1273a35a_2_483x500.png, https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/optimized/4X/5/0/5/505925456d997a1331f0a67089d2437c1273a35a_2_724x750.png 1.5x, https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/optimized/4X/5/0/5/505925456d997a1331f0a67089d2437c1273a35a_2_966x1000.png 2x&quot; data-dominant-color=&quot;F0F5F1&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;55k帖子纯人工手动阅读量，终于飞升3级了，从L站学到了很多，特别是大家都很真诚地讨论问题的氛围非常棒，学生党就抽500次一个月有效期的gemini-3.1-pro-preview-thinking调用次数吧，小小地回馈佬友们。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://cdn.ldstatic.com/images/emoji/twemoji/trophy.png?v=15&quot; title=&quot;:trophy:&quot; class=&quot;emoji&quot; alt=&quot;:trophy:&quot; loading=&quot;lazy&quot; width=&quot;20&quot; height=&quot;20&quot;&gt; 奖品详情：&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;1个500次gemini-3.1-pro-preview-thinking调用次数，有效期一个月&lt;br&gt;
（兑换有效期到2026.07.15）&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://cdn.ldstatic.com/images/emoji/twemoji/three_o_clock.png?v=15&quot; title=&quot;:three_o_clock:&quot; class=&quot;emoji&quot; alt=&quot;:three_o_clock:&quot; loading=&quot;lazy&quot; width=&quot;20&quot; height=&quot;20&quot;&gt; 活动时间：&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;开始时间：发帖后开始&lt;br&gt;
截止时间：&lt;span class=&quot;discourse-local-date&quot; data-date=&quot;2026-06-15&quot; data-email-preview=&quot;Mon, Jun 15, 2026 9:00 PM CST&quot; data-time=&quot;21:00:00&quot; data-timezone=&quot;Asia/Shanghai&quot;&gt;Mon, Jun 15, 2026 9:00 PM CST&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://cdn.ldstatic.com/images/emoji/twemoji/memo.png?v=15&quot; title=&quot;:memo:&quot; class=&quot;emoji&quot; alt=&quot;:memo:&quot; loading=&quot;lazy&quot; width=&quot;20&quot; height=&quot;20&quot;&gt; 参与方式：&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;在本贴下回复任意内容即可参与。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://cdn.ldstatic.com/images/emoji/twemoji/magnifying_glass_tilted_left.png?v=15&quot; title=&quot;:magnifying_glass_tilted_left:&quot; class=&quot;emoji&quot; alt=&quot;:magnifying_glass_tilted_left:&quot; loading=&quot;lazy&quot; width=&quot;20&quot; height=&quot;20&quot;&gt; 抽奖规则：&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;每位用户仅允许参与一次。&lt;br&gt;
